					"content": "パイモン、実は…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741421403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741421403,
					"content": "今回も早かったな！まばたきする暇もなかったぞ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
